"ставьте первое число."
msgstr ""
"From this date the calculation takes the new value; months before it are "
"still calculated as before. Rules are taken for the whole month, so a date "
"in the middle of a month only takes effect from the next one — to make the "
"edit apply to the whole month, use the first day."

