"прежнему — нужна была правка с начала месяца, заведите версию с %(first)s."
msgstr ""
"The version is dated %(date)s, but it will only take effect starting with "
"the %(starts)s payroll: rules are taken for the whole month. %(inside)s "
"stays calculated as before — if you needed the edit from the start of the "
"month, create a version dated %(first)s instead."

